tool_tip.xyz with 250 atoms of tip model bonded below the handle, at exactly the same pose. What it pins: binding is a tag lookup and one rigid fit, so a tip of hundreds of atoms binds to the same pose as the bare tooltip, with no search over its atoms. Same first six atoms, same order.
